;; Native GTK4/GIO explorer. Context owns strings and loop; widgets own rows.
;; Offsets: loop0 window8 list16 entry24 status32 directory40 selection48
;; state-path56 request-path64 last-request72 rebuilding80 GError-slot88.
;; popover96 pointer scratch104/112 rectangle120..135 file-slot136
;; copy-in-flight144 close-pending152. Async copy keeps ctx alive until done.
;; response-path160 last-serialized-state168; only command dispatch writes response.
;; task176 cancellable184 cancel-path192 destination-entry200 confirmation208
;; confirmation-source216 pending-request224. Main-context ownership only.
;; last-consumed232 previous-publish-good240; acknowledged ID stays at72.
;; incoming-copy-destination248 owns a path until legacy DND completion.
;; selection-path256 batch-result-path264 selected-array272 count280 valid288
;; raw/request scratch296/304 frozen-confirmation-array312 count320.
;; Workspace main-context ownership: path336 tabs344 count352 active-index360
;; next-ID368 rebuilding376 render-ok384 tabs-bar392 executable400 busy-request408.
;; actual-engine-completion416 protects file results from snapshot I/O errors.
;; presentation-override424 view-path432; bookmark paths440/448/456/464,
;; bookmark-owned-path-array472 count480 config-valid488; controls496..536,
;; presentation-control-guard544 bookmark-snapshot-health552 Up-button560.
;; Tab: ID0 directory8 history-array16 history-count24 history-index32
;; selection-array40 selection-count48 filter56 sort64 order72 hidden80 view88.
;; Histories own at most128 path strings. Filter owns its UTF-8 string.
;; Job: op0 source8 destination16 cancellable24 error32 request40 result48
;; count56 ancestor-identities64 may-have-created72. GTask owns job and strings.
;; UI-only extension: ctx728 owns a 160-byte main-context struct. It contains
;; transfer-dialog0 entry8 operation16 frozen-paths24 count32 directory40,
;; More-popover48 Cancel-button56 spinner64 reverse-sort-button72.
;; Common action buttons Copy80 Cut88 Paste96 Rename104 New-folder112
;; Trash120 Undo128; exact-target menu buttons Copy136 Move144; prompt-error152.
;; Existing context offsets and worker/provider ownership are unchanged.
